    "Main tower way 39449840 has Q499486 and a stepped 49.8 × 49 m envelope in this signed frame. The three-level wing way 886044291 shares the entire negative-X central tower edge, then extends geographically west toward West Peachtree Street. The wing is not the independent Emory parking building to its south.",
